      "id": "K01",
      "title": "节奏与和声的双重角色",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "tags": [
        "role"
      ],
      "level": "early-intermediate",
      "prerequisites": [],
      "sourceRefs": [
        "S01",
        "S02"
      ],
      "explanation": "贝斯常同时支撑节奏与和声；节奏不是只能依赖鼓手。",
      "exercise": "同一个根音弹四分音符与带休止的八分节奏，比较它们与鼓点的关系。",
      "caveat": "不能据此把所有乐器的乐理需求排成高低顺序。",
      "evidenceType": "source_based_paraphrase",
      "reviewStatus": "draft_needs_bass_teacher_review",
      "version": "0.1",
      "styleScope": [
        "general_intro"
      ],
      "retrievalPrompts": [
        "节奏与和声的双重角色",
        "如何在歌曲中练习节奏与和声的双重角色"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "method": "demonstration_and_self_explanation",
        "requiresRecording": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K02",
      "title": "节拍细分",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "tags": [
        "rhythm"
      ],
      "level": "early-intermediate",
      "prerequisites": [
        "K01"
      ],
      "sourceRefs": [
        "S08"
      ],
      "explanation": "在 4/4 且四分音符为一拍时，一拍可等分为两个八分、四个十六分或三个八分三连音。",
      "exercise": "先口数 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 &，再只弹每拍的 &。",
      "caveat": "swing 与 straight 的时间比例不同，不能永远用平均格评分。",
      "evidenceType": "source_based_paraphrase",
      "reviewStatus": "draft_needs_bass_teacher_review",
